        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion BR-C7, River Rock Collection Rainier Lever with Scalloped Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sandcast Bronze Rainier Lever with Large Scalloped Plate is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose from medium bronze, dark bronze, and antique pewter finishes. Part of Fusion's River Rock Collection, the Rainier Leverset is a great example of how hardware inspired by nature can be both elegant and beautiful. Fusion's BR-C7 has an optional 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sandcasting</b> is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten Bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Sandcast Bronze Rainier Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>True Bronze Product (Sandcast and Lost Wax) with over 90% Copper Content</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Fusion BR Rainier Lever with C7 Large Scalloped Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 5-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
